WEBVTT

00:03:59.414 --> 00:04:02.345
biz qanchalik oz bilishimiz, ilm-fanga
qanchalik oz ma'lumligi

00:04:02.345 --> 00:04:04.896
meni eng hayratga solgan narsa bo‘ldi.
Har kuni mendan

00:04:05.479 --> 00:04:06.270
ota-onalar va

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.062
o‘qituvchilar

00:04:07.062 --> 00:04:09.987
so‘rashadi: "Bolalarda qanday qilib
matonatni shakllantiraman?

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:13.011
Ularga mustahkam ish o'rgatish uchun
nima qilishim kerak?

00:04:13.081 --> 00:04:16.176
Ularning motivatsiyasini uzoq vaqtga
qanday ushlab tursa bo‘ladi?"

00:04:16.286 --> 00:04:17.656
Ochiqchasiga javob bersam,

00:04:17.726 --> 00:04:18.503
Men bilmayman.

00:04:18.682 --> 00:04:19.390
(Kulgi)

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.135
Biladiganim shuki, iqtidor sizni matonatli
qilib qo‘ymaydi.

00:04:23.285 --> 00:04:25.454
Bizdagi ma'lumotlar aniq-ravshan
qilib shuni

00:04:25.584 --> 00:04:27.849
ko‘rsatadiki, o‘z majburiyatlarini ado

00:04:27.849 --> 00:04:31.322
etishda sobitqadam bo‘lmagan ko‘p
iqtidor egalari bor.